      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "MORE THAN WORDS (3) box seated before sticking on well to finish 4 lengths away in third (26.07) at Geelong in a Grade 5 over 460m. Capable of going well again. DR. TRACIE (1) has a strong winning strike-rate over this track and trip with two wins and a placing from five tries. In the money last time at Sale (24.73) in a Grade 5, finishing a 2 length second. Looks one of the chances. PINK MOSCATO (7) wasn't far away at the finish when 4th and beaten only 3 lengths (17.29) at Healesville. The form out of the last run is proven to be strong. Cannot be taken lightly. SUBLIME (6) cannot be written off despite a miss here at his latest outing.",
